    {
      "title": "Comparison with Weight Pruning Methods. We compare our proposed expert pruning method with the representative weight pruning algorithm Wanda. For a fair comparison, we set r=4 in our method and test Wanda with the commonly used structured 2:4 sparsity pattern. This will lead to around 50% parameter reduction for both methods. The results are shown in Tab. 1. The inference speedup of 2:4 structured model relies on specially designed hardware (Mishra et al., 2021) and scripts. In our experiments, we even observe a lower infer-",
